{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/7bfeff651f3f66057865ae2132d27745.avif?t=1759164853\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What\u2019s in this demo?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large dig site reaching <strong>20 m</strong> deep</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An excavation tool <strong>upgradeable up to 4 levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 distinct stations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of caves</strong> and <strong>treasure chests</strong> to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An island <strong>survivor</strong> NPC to <strong>trade</strong> crafted/found items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buildable</strong> elevator, scaffolding, and ropes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment:</strong> dynamite, energy cartridges, jetpack, medkit, detector, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/311c2eeb9214023ae0841ad14431b6ef.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After a plane crash, you wake up on a mysterious island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Starting with nothing, you must <strong>gather, craft, and repair</strong> your plane to escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">To endure, you must dig, craft, and descend into the depths of the earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But you are not alone, working together <strong>with your friends</strong> may be the only way to find <strong>escape.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/2d801ca8acf7035a64b2f4080ab411a0.poster.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/2d801ca8acf7035a64b2f4080ab411a0.webm?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/2d801ca8acf7035a64b2f4080ab411a0.mp4?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/54e7a2500ffea54a110b34640c903df8.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The <strong>Digging</strong> is your lifeline. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">At first, you uncover Stone, Coal, and Quartz. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Every strike drains your energy, forcing you to carefully balance risk and reward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Deeper layers mean greater riches, but also harsher survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/b9923a5a58552cc5c5a71363375cb210.poster.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/b9923a5a58552cc5c5a71363375cb210.webm?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/b9923a5a58552cc5c5a71363375cb210.mp4?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/c07ffd4873295a8c40c74f8339f7235f.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every Ore you collect is more than just raw material \u2013 it\u2019s the foundation of progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Chop trees with your Axe to produce Wood logs and planks.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Use the <strong>Furnace</strong> to refine ores into Ingots.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Build tools and structures at the <strong>Craft Station</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each station you unlock expands your crafting possibilities and brings you one step closer to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/4fdde9712d11e4c1e10f8e316e0cd707.poster.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/4fdde9712d11e4c1e10f8e316e0cd707.webm?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/4fdde9712d11e4c1e10f8e316e0cd707.mp4?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/a688a71d178daf85c6ed77e95e7d4df5.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Digging and descending aren\u2019t free. Your energy is constantly draining. Without it, shovels dig much slower, and drills can\u2019t operate at all. Managing power remains a constant struggle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The <strong>Generator</strong> fuels stations and Elevators using Wood, Coal, or Crude Oil.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The <strong>Supply Station</strong> restores your health and energy for money.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The <strong>Power Cartridge</strong> provides a single-use energy refill in the field.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Energy directly affects your pace. Without it, progress slows or even comes to a halt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/29951d612db33c97b87aef826a1aca80.poster.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/29951d612db33c97b87aef826a1aca80.webm?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/29951d612db33c97b87aef826a1aca80.mp4?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/90de71c8c47c26b521f929e2997fd6ae.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">To collect the necessary materials, you must construct the <strong>Elevator</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With ropes and foundations, you build a lifeline back to the surface. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you progress, stronger materials lead to faster and safer travel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Elevator not only carries you upward but also transports your resources and even recharges your power. It is the backbone of your exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/b3afcef8504cdab672fa5a9497fb6be9.poster.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/b3afcef8504cdab672fa5a9497fb6be9.webm?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/b3afcef8504cdab672fa5a9497fb6be9.mp4?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/efc9afdd00786d4393ad4192d54cc162.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dig Island comes alive in <strong>4-player Co-Op</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Communication, teamwork, and strategy are the keys to conquering the island\u2019s depths and finding your way back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/128454f8165607c51e7fa6cf95f936c3.poster.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/128454f8165607c51e7fa6cf95f936c3.webm?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/128454f8165607c51e7fa6cf95f936c3.mp4?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4062690?t=1759164853","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/a18d6ebf8f5b61a19db515199e98795528bc8161/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1759164853","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/9a778dd11a03eac69a0a3f47bfdfea1e16f32d2f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759164853","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/9a778dd11a03eac69a0a3f47bfdfea1e16f32d2f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759164853","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/7bfeff651f3f66057865ae2132d27745.avif?t=1759164853\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >What\u2019s in this demo?</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large dig site reaching <strong>20 m</strong> deep</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An excavation tool <strong>upgradeable up to 4 levels</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>6 distinct stations</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dozens of caves</strong> and <strong>treasure chests</strong> to discover</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >An island <strong>survivor</strong> NPC to <strong>trade</strong> crafted/found items</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Buildable</strong> elevator, scaffolding, and ropes</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Equipment:</strong> dynamite, energy cartridges, jetpack, medkit, detector, and more</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/311c2eeb9214023ae0841ad14431b6ef.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">After a plane crash, you wake up on a mysterious island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Starting with nothing, you must <strong>gather, craft, and repair</strong> your plane to escape. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">To endure, you must dig, craft, and descend into the depths of the earth. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">But you are not alone, working together <strong>with your friends</strong> may be the only way to find <strong>escape.</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/2d801ca8acf7035a64b2f4080ab411a0.poster.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/2d801ca8acf7035a64b2f4080ab411a0.webm?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/2d801ca8acf7035a64b2f4080ab411a0.mp4?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/54e7a2500ffea54a110b34640c903df8.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The <strong>Digging</strong> is your lifeline. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">At first, you uncover Stone, Coal, and Quartz. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> Every strike drains your energy, forcing you to carefully balance risk and reward. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Deeper layers mean greater riches, but also harsher survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/b9923a5a58552cc5c5a71363375cb210.poster.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/b9923a5a58552cc5c5a71363375cb210.webm?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/b9923a5a58552cc5c5a71363375cb210.mp4?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/c07ffd4873295a8c40c74f8339f7235f.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Every Ore you collect is more than just raw material \u2013 it\u2019s the foundation of progress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Chop trees with your Axe to produce Wood logs and planks.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Use the <strong>Furnace</strong> to refine ores into Ingots.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Build tools and structures at the <strong>Craft Station</strong>.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Each station you unlock expands your crafting possibilities and brings you one step closer to survival.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/4fdde9712d11e4c1e10f8e316e0cd707.poster.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/4fdde9712d11e4c1e10f8e316e0cd707.webm?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/4fdde9712d11e4c1e10f8e316e0cd707.mp4?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/a688a71d178daf85c6ed77e95e7d4df5.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Digging and descending aren\u2019t free. Your energy is constantly draining. Without it, shovels dig much slower, and drills can\u2019t operate at all. Managing power remains a constant struggle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The <strong>Generator</strong> fuels stations and Elevators using Wood, Coal, or Crude Oil.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The <strong>Supply Station</strong> restores your health and energy for money.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>The <strong>Power Cartridge</strong> provides a single-use energy refill in the field.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Energy directly affects your pace. Without it, progress slows or even comes to a halt.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/29951d612db33c97b87aef826a1aca80.poster.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/29951d612db33c97b87aef826a1aca80.webm?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/29951d612db33c97b87aef826a1aca80.mp4?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/90de71c8c47c26b521f929e2997fd6ae.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">To collect the necessary materials, you must construct the <strong>Elevator</strong>. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">With ropes and foundations, you build a lifeline back to the surface. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">As you progress, stronger materials lead to faster and safer travel. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">The Elevator not only carries you upward but also transports your resources and even recharges your power. It is the backbone of your exploration.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/b3afcef8504cdab672fa5a9497fb6be9.poster.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/b3afcef8504cdab672fa5a9497fb6be9.webm?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/b3afcef8504cdab672fa5a9497fb6be9.mp4?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/efc9afdd00786d4393ad4192d54cc162.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Dig Island comes alive in <strong>4-player Co-Op</strong>.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Communication, teamwork, and strategy are the keys to conquering the island\u2019s depths and finding your way back home.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/128454f8165607c51e7fa6cf95f936c3.poster.avif?t=1759164853\" width=780 height=260 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/128454f8165607c51e7fa6cf95f936c3.webm?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/extras/128454f8165607c51e7fa6cf95f936c3.mp4?t=1759164853\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["FiftyEight Studios"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3919360","name":"Dig Island"},"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4062690/f31e2bb7c85158680ac8786b91b512836422b580/header.jpg?t=1759164853","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4062690/1942805340/e1ce272ba24d5005c39352962f12230e49024a7d/1758888952/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759135277","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4062690/1942805340/e1ce272ba24d5005c39352962f12230e49024a7d/1758888952/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759135277","highlight":true,"hls_h264"